name: sim.readCustomDataBlockTags
description: Deprecated. See sim.readCustomDataTags instead
luaSynopsis: list tags = sim.readCustomDataBlockTags(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: string[] tags = sim.readCustomDataBlockTags(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object, sim.handle_scene or sim.handle_app
outputs:
1. tags: an array of tags or None/nil if no tags are present
replacedBy:
- name: getPropertyName, class: object, object_getPropertyName.method, note: "use the 'customData.'-prefix option"
